=== hooks/gate-inbox-claude-delegation-<stamp>.md
Gate Inbox manages this session. Before handing work to another agent (Agent, Task or Workflow tool), load the gate-inbox:delegate-with-gate-inbox skill: real work goes to create_session sessions on the user's board.

